Section: Computer Engg. vs IT Engg. vs CSE
Comparison:
[
  {
    "Branch": "Computer Engineering (CE)",
    "Focus": "Hardware + Software",
    "Key Subjects": "Microprocessors, OS, Networks",
    "Career Paths": "Embedded Systems, System Admin, Cybersecurity, Web Dev"
  },
  {
    "Branch": "Information Technology (IT)",
    "Focus": "Software & Systems",
    "Key Subjects": "Web, DBMS, Cloud, Security",
    "Career Paths": "Web Dev, DB Admin, IT Support"
  },
  {
    "Branch": "Computer Science & Engineering (CSE)",
    "Focus": "Deep CS & Theory",
    "Key Subjects": "AI, ML, Data Science, Algorithms",
    "Career Paths": "Software Dev, Data Scientist, AI/ML Engineer, Web Dev"
  }
]
Note: All three have overlapping subjects and strong career options. Choose based on interest in theory (CSE), systems (IT), or hardware + software (CE).
